  <div class="pj-text" style="--x:86;--w:1144;margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 117)">
    <p>This project encompasses the complete renovation of a 1960s home in one of Madrid’s most exclusive neighbourhoods. Once the private retreat of a renowned sculptor, the residence enters a new chapter, its spaces reshaped around light, openness and a closer connection to nature.</p>
    <p>Expansion and spatial unity guide the transformation, creating generous, interconnected rooms where daylight flows freely and the surrounding greenery becomes part of everyday life. The boundaries between indoors and out soften, bringing the quiet rhythm of nature into the heart of the home.</p>
    <p>Echoing its artistic past, the house is sculpted anew through space and light: an intimate refuge with room to breathe.</p>
    <p class="pj-note" data-lang="en">* We designed this project and ran the site supervision as part of the Crimson team.</p>
    <p class="pj-note" data-lang="es">* Este proyecto lo diseñamos e hicimos la dirección de obra como parte del equipo de Crimson.</p>
